      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(2) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person, in trade or commerce, offers for supply goods of a particular kind; and  (b) an information standard for goods of that kind is in force; and  (c) the person has not complied with the standard in relation to the goods.",
