      },
      "cml:operator": "relation between temporal intervals",
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) In a proceeding relating to a contravention or possible contravention of this Division (other than a criminal proceeding), an agreement is presumed to be an unsolicited consumer agreement"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-70-ss-1-logic-cogai-5",
