      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "if:  (a) a party to the proceeding alleges that the agreement is an unsolicited consumer agreement; and  (b) no other party to the proceeding proves that the agreement is not an unsolicited consumer agreement.",
