    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-9-ss-4-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The inference is not valid.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Safety defect inference",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": ">",
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) An inference that goods have a safety defect is not to be made only because:  (a) there was compliance with a Commonwealth mandatory standard for them; and  (b) that standard was not the safest possible standard having regard to the latest state of scientific or technical knowledge when they were supplied by their manufacturer."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-9-ss-4-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The inference is valid before the standard was met.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Safety defect inference",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "<",
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) An inference that goods have a safety defect is not to be made only because:  (a) there was compliance with a Commonwealth mandatory standard for them; and  (b) that standard was not the safest possible standard having regard to the latest state of scientific or technical knowledge when they were supplied by their manufacturer."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-2-sec-9-ss-4-logic-ltl-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The inference is valid before the standard was not met.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
